// Conformance fixture for ta.cci (S-bead OpenBBTechnical-0e9.5.25, Wave 5B-2).
//
// Author-derivative posture per PRD §7.3: reference output computed
// deterministically by running this script's CCI formula against a
// hard-coded synthetic close series (see ta_cci.csv `close` column).
// No chart data is redistributed; the .csv is a pure function of this .pine.
//
// CCI(close, length) = (close - sma(close, length)) / (0.015 * mean_dev),
// where mean_dev is the mean absolute deviation of close over the same
// window. Warm-up returns NA until bar (length - 1).
//@version=6
indicator("smoke_ta_cci", overlay=false)
plot(ta.cci(close, 5), title="cci5")
